  "prefLabel": "Bea 505.04 Eligible HPRM Grant Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 505.04 Eligible HPRM Grant Activities. HPRM grant funds shall be used by the applicant to procure consultation, technical assistance, or other professional services from third-party providers for the scope of work proposed by the municipality in its grant application.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bea500.html"
